SUMMARY:[Hike - Intermediate] Long Sault Conservation Area\, 8-9kms/2hrs
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nPlease join us in a hike at Long Sault! Pl
 ease wear sturdy hiking boots and bring 1l of water. Hiking poles are help
 ful but not required. We will hike 8-9kms at a steady pace and will stop f
 or short breaks along the way.\n\nLong Sault Conservation Area's natural b
 eauty can be explored on any section of the more than 18 km of marked trai
 ls that wind throughout the property.\n\nNestled in the heart of the provi
 ncially significant Oak Ridges Moraine\, Long Sault Conservation Area (\\~
 400 hectares) is the largest conservation area owned and managed by Centra
 l Lake Ontario Conservation.\n\nHike starts promptly at 9:35.\n\n**\\*\\*\
 \*\\* NOTE \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* We are NOT meeting at the main parking lot.**\n
 We are going to meet at Concession Road 10 off of Hwy 57.\nGo north on Hwy
  57 to Concession 10.\nTurn right and travel to the where the road turns l
 eft and becomes Avery Road. ([https://goo.gl/maps/2yR3wiL5GvM3Jg9h9](https
 ://goo.gl/maps/2yR3wiL5GvM3Jg9h9)).\n\nAs always\, this is a busy spot and
  you should car pool whenever possible.\n\n**Note:** Google Maps will some
 times take you too far to the west. The parking is at the corner of Conces
 sion 10 and Avery Road.\n\nWinter Hiking Season Information:\n\nPlease not
 e that as we get into winter hiking with snow and slippery trails\, we con
 sider proper Crampons to be mandatory.\n\nThe event host can ask you not t
 o participate if you don't have proper footwear including Crampons. More C
 rampon Information.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\n
 By RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming 
 that you have read\, understand and accept the following:\n\n1. **GTA Hiki
 ng Meetup is a private group. Attending events is voluntary by you as a me
 mber. Participation in any activity with us is at your own risk.**\n2. **B
 y joining this event as a member you agree to indemnify and hold harmless 
 its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, event hosts\, and 
 other members from all claims or liability of every type (including court 
 costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any person or for damage to p
 roperty\, loss of personal property or any other wrongful act arising out 
 of or relating to your participation as a member.** This agreement applies
  to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may accompany you in the
 se endeavors.\n3. **You also agree to hold the organizers as well as other
  group members harmless.** By participating voluntarily in the group\, you
  expressly waive any and all such claims against each and every other memb
 er in the group\, including without limitation any and all claims against 
 the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, and event hos
 ts.
